The Code Mode tool catalog has changed. This catalog supersedes the previous Code Mode tool catalog.

The Code Mode tool catalog below is partial.

The Code Mode catalog and `search` results are the complete set of tools callable inside `execute`. It does not affect tools exposed directly outside Code Mode.

## Search

Call `search(...)` to discover exact paths and signatures for additional tools:

